SY_TALK("Jh3fvle0jKQ",[[33,["First three minutes are without sound."]],[176,["But as I told you there could be good conditionings."]],[181,["In the way, in the same way, you can have good habits"]],[187,["If habits inhibit"]],[190,["or obstruct your ascent,"]],[196,["they also can help to stabilize you."]],[209,["The conditioning comes to you from the matter"]],[213,["with which we are dealing every day."]],[218,["When a human being sees the matter, he aggresses it"]],[223,["and he wants to use that matter for his own purpose."]],[228,["He changes the forms of the matter for his own purpose."]],[233,["He starts getting used to matter"]],[238,["as comfort, or as a help or a guide in life."]],[246,["The more you start depending on matter,"]],[249,["the more your spontaneity is finished,"]],[253,["because you’re dealing with the dead."]],[259,["Matter, when it is dead, then only we deal with it."]],[263,["When it is living we are not so much bothered about it."]],[268,["So the deadness of that matter settles within us"]],[273,["when we start using that matter for our purpose."]],[279,["But how are we to otherwise exist, is the question people can ask."]],[284,["If God has given us this material things and this matter to be used,"]],[289,["are we not supposed to use them?"]],[292,["And are we not supposed to enjoy them?"]],[298,["But we don’t enjoy really.."]],[302,["Before realization you cannot enjoy any matter."]],[307,["You can only form a habit"]],[310,["and may become a slave of that matter, before realization."]],[315,["It’s a principle of, fundamental principle of economics"]],[320,["that wants in general are never satiable."]],[324,["Means today you want to buy something like a carpet."]],[327,["All right, you bought it."]],[329,["So now that carpet becomes a headache,"]],[333,["because it’s your possession, you have to look after it."]],[337,["You have to insure it, you have to worry about it"]],[339,["that it doesn’t get spoiled, first of all."]],[344,["And secondly you really get"]],[346,["into another mood of buying something else."]],[350,["Now you have bought the carpet, finished."]],[353,["Then you have to have something else,"]],[355,["then you have to have s.th. else, then you have to have s.th. else."]],[358,["So it does not satiate you; it does not give you the joy."]],[364,["Matter can never give you joy."]],[367,["It’s the Spirit that gives you joy."]],[371,["And when the ascent takes place,"]],[373,["when you become the Spirit, then matter takes"]],[377,["another value system within ourselves;"]],[380,["the value system of matter is very different."]],[385,["As I’m sure Jason must have told you"]],[388,["that when you get your realization,"]],[390,["then you start feeling the cool breeze in the hand."]],[398,["In relationship to matter"]],[400,["it’s very helpful to be a realized soul,"]],[404,["because immediately you know"]],[408,["what is good for you and what is bad for you."]],[412,["For example, you eat something that’s not good for you:"]],[416,["Immediately you’ll lose your vibrations and will become hot."]],[420,["Even looking at it, it may happen."]],[423,["You want to sit on a chair"]],[424,["on which somebody who is a very wrong type of a person has sat,"]],[429,["immediately you’ll feel, “Oh, something wrong in this place.”"]],[433,["With your vibrations, which is a definite thing, an absolute thing."]],[440,["And this conditioning can only be over –"]],[444,["these habits can be overcome only if you become the Spirit,"]],[448,["because Spirit is always dominated by the matter."]],[453,["And the Spirit has to overcome that domination of the matter."]],[459,["Actually, Spirit cannot be dominated by anything."]],[463,["But what I mean is that it is covered,"]],[466,["like the sun can be covered with clouds."]],[471,["In the same way all our domination,"]],[475,["or we can say all our enslavement of the matter,"]],[482,["makes us dominate our Spirit in the sense that"]],[485,["we cover it up."]],[486,["The clouds are there, we can’t see the Spirit. We can’t feel it."]],[489,["The spontaneity which is the beauty of the Spirit"]],[493,["we do not feel in a person."]],[496,["So, in judging a person, what do we judge?"]],[498,["How that person looks, what dress he’s wearing,"]],[502,["how he walks, what are his formal ways,"]],[505,["does he know how to say “Thank you”, “Sorry” or not, you see?"]],[508,["All these things impress us very much."]],[510,["What sort of a car he has, what sort of a house."]],[514,["Maybe we may miss, we may miss a saint."]],[521,["We may miss Christ again"]],[524,["because He was a carpenter’s son."]],[527,["How are we to know who is Christ?"]],[530,["Is there any way of finding out who is Christ?"]],[536,["Many people are now talking “Christ is going to come,"]],[539,["He’s going to come on the television.”"]],[540,["You can put up anyone there as Christ."]],[544,["How are we going to make it out?"]],[546,["By His dress or by some sort of a thing they have done?"]],[550,["Most of the paintings of Christ and most of His statues"]],[554,["that I’ve seen are no where near Christ,"]],[556,["no where near Christ, you see."]],[558,["They are horrid things. I don’t know what are they."]],[562,["So how will you make it out that this is Christ or not?"]],[566,["Or this is some sort of a hokus pokus fellow"]],[568,["or some sort of a person who has come just deliberately"]],[572,["to delude us from reality."]],[576,["There is no way out, to find out"]],[581,["what is the truth because"]],[584,["we are so much used to material forms that we have."]],[587,["For example, our idea of art also is in the same way moulded."]],[596,["We like this kind of art."]],[598,["If you ask them, “Why?”"]],[599,["“Because, you know, this has this kind of a thing – harmony”,"]],[604,["or maybe, “this is more proportioned” and all that."]],[607,["But how do you know?”"]],[610,["You know because you’ve read certain books or maybe"]],[613,["that you have understood from somebody else"]],[619,["that this is art, this is beautiful."]],[623,["I mean, you brand something as beautiful, but is it really?"]],[626,["If it is beauty, it should be Spirit,"]],[629,["because Spirit is beauty and beauty is Spirit."]],[632,["So is it, is it beauty? How do you make out"]],[636,["that this art is beautiful or not?"]],[640,["For example, according to all normal ideas of womanhood,"]],[644,["I don’t think Mona Lisa is a beautiful woman."]],[647,["I mean the way these days you see mosquito-like women"]],[650,["are regarded as beautiful."]],[652,["So how they call Mona Lisa so beautiful?"]],[655,["What’s in her?"]],[657,["Thousands of people would be assembled to see that painting"]],[660,["Why? What has that?"]],[663,["Only vibrations will tell you that it emits vibrations."]],[667,["It appeals to your Spirit without your knowledge."]],[670,["You’re not aware of it. It appeals to your Spirit."]],[673,["That’s why universally that painting is appreciated."]],[679,["But when this conditioning becomes collective,"]],[682,["any such conditioning becomes collective and you accept"]],[685,["“This is the form that is beauty;"]],[689,["this is the form that is reality;"]],[691,["this is the form that is spontaneity”,"]],[695,["then the confusion starts."]],[698,["The confusion starts at that point,"]],[701,["when it becomes a collective thing."]],[705,["For example I met some people of some gurus."]],[708,["When I asked them,"]],[711,["“What makes you think that your guru is truthful,"]],[713,["what has he given?"]],[714,["He said, “Because sitting in my chair I just start jumping by myself."]],[718,["I don’t do it but it happens, it’s spontaneous.”"]],[724,["And in My presence, the way his body was moving was so horrifying."]],[728,["Anybody would have tremendous compassion"]],[732,["and concern for such a person,"]],[734,["that you can’t sit for five minutes straight …"]],[736,["Woman: Excuse me, it wasn’t spontaneous, it was nervousness."]],[740,["Yes, that’s what I’m saying …"]],[742,["Woman: You’re very wrong in what You talk."]],[744,["What?"]],[745,["Woman: About everything."]],[747,["From where do you come?"]],[749,["Woman: Up the road."]],[750,["That’s it. Better go."]],[753,["Woman: Don’t worry. I am."]],[756,["Look at that. She’ll go to the pub now."]],[763,["Must try to understand the subtleties, you see?"]],[766,["If you are confirmed with what -"]],[768,["Now supposing somebody starts jumping in the thing"]],[771,["and he say's, - as she says it’s true, nerves,"]],[774,["that means you’re not in control of your nerves, isn’t it?"]],[778,["Don’t you think so?"]],[780,["You’re not in control, you have not controlled."]],[782,["Spontaneity is a thing which is not the thing that makes you a slave."]],[788,["This is the point I’m trying to bring."]],[790,["It doesn’t! It makes you a master."]],[793,["Spontaneity must make you a master"]],[795,["and not a slave of anything."]],[798,["She must have come from TM because TM people jump like that."]],[803,["And they end up as epileptic people."]],[806,["I have cured so many of them."]],[807,["I don’t know if someone has come from there."]],[810,["Even the head of their academy in Scotland,"]],[817,["the flying squad academy, as I call it,"]],[820,["where people pay three thousand – now this gentleman sitting here"]],[823,["is one of them who suffered."]],[825,["When they suffer then they know what it is."]],[829,["The other day we saw somebody with epilepsy of such frequency."]],[833,["The poor child, he was hardly twenty-six years of age,"]],[838,["young man, supposed to enjoy his life,"]],[840,["was going into such trauma, you can’t imagine."]],[847,["And if this is happening to somebody going to a guru, you paid for it,"]],[851,["how can it be anywhere near Spirit?"]],[854,["This is what I’m trying to tell you,"]],[857,["that Spirit gives you spontaneity in which you are the master."]],[863,["You are the master of yourself, complete master,"]],[868,["no enslavement of any kind, no habits formation coming."]],[871,["All habits drop out."]],[873,["You become so, so spontaneous that I don’t have to tell you."]],[876,["You just drop out all habits and you become a master of your self."]],[881,["That should happen to you."]],[884,["Instead of that, if you indulge into things which enslave you,"]],[889,["you will like it for a while because you can’t help it."]],[893,["But if really sit down,"]],[895,["you will know that it’s not the thing that you wanted."]],[898,["You wanted to be the master of yourself."]],[901,["Now here in this map as we show we have two powers,"]],[905,["left and right powers."]],[906,["The left power is the power that gives us conditioning –"]],[911,["left side, the subconscious, the collective subconscious."]],[914,["That gives us the conditioning."]],[917,["Now, if you try to deny all that,"]],[919,["then the right side is even worse."]],[921,["It gives us action, but with action we can become very ego oriented."]],[927,["So both ways it can be troublesome."]],[930,["Supposing you say that “All right,"]],[932,["I have no conditioning of any kind."]],[934,["What’s wrong in doing this? What’s wrong in doing that?”"]],[937,["And if you just move with that idea, with that freedom,"]],[942,["it will be abandonment, it may not be freedom."]],[945,["Because freedom must have wisdom behind it."]],[949,["So both the sides, the movements on both the sides are wrong."]],[955,["So what is all right, In the center?"]],[958,["Is not to get conditioned by anything"]],[961,["and not to be ego oriented."]],[965,["But how to do it is the problem."]],[967,["The problem is how to do it."]],[970,["To be spontaneous is to be absolutely free."]],[976,["Now I would consider these two powers as say,"]],[979,["a brake and an accelerator in a car."]],[983,["Now you use both the powers."]],[985,["You use the brake first, you use the accelerator."]],[988,["You try to control these two powers."]],[991,["But, first of all it is difficult to understand"]],[994,["how you can use these powers."]],[996,["Gradually, with practice you’ll do it."]],[998,["You know how to drive the car, you become the good driver."]],[1003,["After becoming the good driver,"]],[1005,["still you are not the master of the driving."]],[1008,["But then you become the master."]],[1011,["So, today the master within us, within us is the Spirit."]],[1016,["But before realization, we are not the master"]],[1020,["because the master has not come in our conscious mind."]],[1025,["It is not expressing in our conscious mind."]],[1028,["In the sense that we are not empowered by its powers."]],[1036,["The Spirit exists; It has Its own powers."]],[1039,["But we haven’t felt those powers within us."]],[1042,["Once we feel the powers of the Spirit,"]],[1045,["we are empowered by our own powers which are there."]],[1050,["The powers are within us."]],[1053,["These are our own powers."]],[1055,["We don’t have to borrow from anyone, ask from anyone,"]],[1058,["they are in ourselves."]],[1060,["The Spirit is within us –"]],[1061,["only thing that Spirit has to give light in our,"]],[1067,["in our consciousness."]],[1070,["It has to come in our consciousness."]],[1073,["In simple medical terminology we can see, say,"]],[1077,["that the Spirit must manifest Itself in our central nervous system,"]],[1084,["in our central nervous system,"]],[1087,["so that we should know what we are doing."]],[1089,["Not that we start just jumping on the,"]],[1093,["on the chair, or some people said, “Oh, we just start doing it.”"]],[1097,["It is hypnosis."]],[1100,["It’s not correct. You are not in conscious mind."]],[1102,["You are doing it out of hypnosis."]],[1105,["Hypnosis may be coming from outside force."]],[1108,["It’s not your force, your awareness,"]],[1111,["your understanding, your power."]],[1114,["It is somebody else’s because you’re not doing it."]],[1120,["As matter has a power to overpower us, in the same way"]],[1124,["there are some material things, I should say,"]],[1127,["which are very dangerous, which are placed."]],[1130,["For example now cancer, take cancer,"]],[1133,["cancer overpowers you."]],[1134,["It’s a very serious thing."]],[1136,["Cancer overpowers you; you cannot overpower cancer."]],[1139,["Take a very concrete example."]],[1141,["Now how is it caused?"]],[1143,["Doctors say this way, that way."]],[1145,["We, Sahaja Yoga can cure cancer, definitely,"]],[1148,["hundred percent it can cure, it has cured."]],[1150,["Many Sahaja Yogis have cured cancer."]],[1152,["How? Is very simple."]],[1155,["That you become master of yourself and you master the disease also."]],[1159,["You master everything."]],[1164,["Because the master is within you,"]],[1166,["it has not come in your conscious mind"]],[1169,["is the only link is left,"]],[1170,["and when that happens Yoga takes place, union takes place."]],[1174,["We should now completely keep ourselves"]],[1178,["limited to Self-realization, about God I’ll tell next time."]],[1184,["Self-realization means to bring your Spirit into your conscious mind."]],[1190,["Now how cancer is caused? Let’s see here what happens."]],[1194,["It is caused by left-sided activity."]],[1197,["Now left sided activities are emotional traumas,"]],[1202,["emotional problems, emotional upheavals,"]],[1207,["emotional insecurities –"]],[1209,["any kind of insecurity can take you to the left side."]],[1213,["Little more movement can be these horrible gurus"]],[1216,["because they hypnotize you."]],[1217,["They put you to the left."]],[1219,["They put some Spirit in you or I don’t know what they do,"]],[1222,["but they put you to the left."]],[1224,["Any one of these activities which are not authorized by God,"]],[1229,["taken to, you go to the left side,"]],[1231,["because you cannot ascend in the center."]],[1234,["So either you go to the left or to the right."]],[1236,["When you overdo these things, like black magic -"]],[1240,["you have another thing here I’ve heard,"]],[1245,["some sort of a organization head -"]],[1247,["and the fellow you see, he used to -"]],[1249,["everything he saw moving in the house."]],[1252,["He came to Sahaja Yoga and"]],[1254,["his water jug was moving there and this was moving there"]],[1258,["and he couldn’t explain what was happening in his room."]],[1260,["He was sitting down and he found something moving from here to here"]],[1263,["It happens. What is that?"]],[1266,["What is that doing this kind of a thing which you cannot control."]],[1269,["Again we come to the same point –"]],[1271,["something you cannot control."]],[1273,["So you enter into the realm,"]],[1276,["into the realm where you are controlled"]],[1279,["and you are not under your own control."]],[1281,["And that realm, when you enter in,"]],[1285,["I have always seen all the cancer patients"]],[1288,["are the ones affected by this."]],[1292,["Most surprising."]],[1295,["They are not aware; they do not know how they get into it."]],[1298,["For a lady, supposing, say she’s suffering"]],[1301,["from an insecurity about her husband or maybe something,"]],[1305,["or maybe she thinks that her husband may leave her any time."]],[1308,["She loves him. Whatever it is."]],[1311,["Such a woman might get a breast cancer,"]],[1315,["because the insecurities set in, in one of the centers there"]],[1319,["which you can see here, the center of the heart -"]],[1323,["Center Heart, as we call it."]],[1325,["Now if this center goes out of order,"]],[1330,["if a woman feels insecure for anything whatsoever,"]],[1333,["she’s capable – she’s vulnerable to be attacked"]],[1337,["and she can get into cancer."]],[1340,["So we have to understand life in totality,"]],[1343,["and not in one way."]],[1346,["The total impact of life, the total effect of life,"]],[1350,["the total relationship with life must be understood."]],[1355,["Now no doctor knows this."]],[1358,["Will he know, when he treats the patient for, say breast cancer,"]],[1363,["will he know that this lady is insecured ?"]],[1368,["There’s another disease – anorexia – many girls suffer from it."]],[1374,["They don’t just eat. They just give up eating."]],[1377,["Now, you do not know why it happens."]],[1380,["Doctors can’t cure it; nobody can cure it."]],[1383,["What is the reason?"]],[1384,["The relationship of a girl, of a daughter with the father."]],[1389,["Say father dies and the daughter doesn’t see the father,"]],[1393,["or she, in heart she loves the father but she doesn’t express it,"]],[1397,["or there’s some bad relationship that comes between"]],[1401,["the father and the daughter,"]],[1404,["you get this trouble anorexia."]],[1406,["You’ll be amazed but it is impossible for doctors to get –"]],[1411,["we have some doctors sitting here –"]],[1413,["it is impossible for any medical science to go near it."]],[1420,["Because they do not see a human being in its totality."]],[1424,["It’s a very delicate instrument God has created."]],[1428,["The way we are harsh with others,"]],[1430,["the way we sometimes try to trouble others,"]],[1437,["try to make others feel insecured are unfair, unjust."]],[1443,["Without our knowledge we really give them a tremendous insecurity."]],[1449,["And such insecurities can work out"]],[1454,["incurable diseases of which we are not aware."]],[1459,["So to understand the totality, what should happen to us?"]],[1463,["We should achieve that state where we can see the totality."]],[1469,["Like if I have to see now, for example,"]],[1472,["the whole of Brighton, what should I do?"]],[1476,["I should go on a plane and see it from that height."]],[1479,["I can see the whole."]],[1481,["In the same way in your awareness, in your understanding,"]],[1484,["you should rise to that point from where you can see the whole."]],[1490,["If you cannot see the whole, the partial vision,"]],[1494,["or we can say, a little that you see can create confusion,"]],[1501,["can create problems"]],[1504,["and some of them could be of a very, very serious nature."]],[1510,["Because as human beings, we do not know what are we."]],[1517,["This is the greatest problem of human beings,"]],[1521,["that they’ll say, “I don’t like it.”"]],[1523,["Now which one is this “I”?"]],[1525,["Is that your Spirit, or is that your ego?"]],[1529,["What is the part that is not liking it?"]],[1532,["Or is it your conditioning,"]],[1534,["because you’re brought up in a particular way so you don’t like this?"]],[1538,["Which part of you is not liking it?"]],[1542,["And you’ll be amazed that it is not your Spirit."]],[1546,["Because if Spirit likes, how will you know?"]],[1551,["It’s only through your vibrations."]],[1553,["When you can feel the vibrations, then only you will say,"]],[1557,["“Yes, my Spirit likes it”,"]],[1558,["because the vibrations have emitted."]],[1562,["So we are still in a transition state as human beings."]],[1566,["We have not achieved that state which is called"]],[1570,["as the state of Self-realization where you become the Spirit -"]],[1575,["the becoming is the point."]],[1578,["Where you become the Spirit you know what you like."]],[1582,["You really know what you really like,"]],[1587,["because you are now the reality,"]],[1589,["you are not any conditioning,"]],[1592,["you are no more an ego but you are what you are really,"]],[1597,["and that is your Spirit."]],[1599,["And surprisingly this Spirit is a collective being,"]],[1603,["is no artificial collectivity within us,"]],[1607,["that also “All right, we belong to all Brighton so we are one\""]],[1610,["or “We belong to one street so we are one.”"]],[1614,["It’s not like that, but is something that you are,"]],[1617,["absolutely you are a collective being!"]],[1620,["And you start feeling that collectivity within you"]],[1623,["with these different centers working it out."]],[1626,["And you can feel it - others,"]],[1630,["you can feel others on your finger tips. Can you believe?"]],[1633,["In the Bible it’s written that your hands will speak."]],[1638,["The description of these days is that your hands will speak."]],[1641,["Why not people go and find out how does it happen?"]],[1643,["How can your hands speak?"]],[1645,["This is what happens that on your finger tips you start feeling"]],[1650,["and understanding what is reality,"]],[1653,["what is beauty, what is joy, what is love."]],[1660,["This is the left side which we get,"]],[1665,["and ultimately with this left side problems we get physical pains."]],[1670,["It’s very painful to have left sided problems –"]],[1674,["it’s very, very painful."]],[1676,["The pain cannot be explained, no one can understand,"]],[1680,["nobody can cure it, you can’t tell anyone"]],[1683,["and people think that you are fussing,"]],[1685,["they give you psychological treatment."]],[1688,["You just don’t understand why this pain is within you."]],[1691,["And this pain comes to you from left side, the subconscious."]],[1697,["The beyond the subconscious is the collective subconscious,"]],[1700,["and this collective subconscious is the one where,"]],[1704,["whatever is created from the beginning up to today"]],[1711,["in the creation is within you."]],[1714,["And once you go to the subconscious, you just get lost there."]],[1719,["You are so overpowered by this power of subconscious"]],[1723,["that it is beyond you to understand it,"]],[1728,["beyond you to get out of it and beyond you to –"]],[1733,["not to succumb to it."]],[1735,["And it goes on increasing."]],[1737,["Like I asked some people: “Why did you go on doing it"]],[1740,["when you knew that you were not doing it,"]],[1743,["somebody else was doing it? Still why did you continue to do it?”"]],[1746,["They said: “Mother, we were under the blanket,"]],[1749,["it was darkness, we didn’t know where we were moving"]],[1751,["and were just going on and on and on.”"]],[1755,["And as I told you last time, feeling guilty is the biggest blockade."]],[1760,["Is the biggest blockade because once you start feeling guilty"]],[1763,["that- this center on the left gets blocked and the –"]],[1768,["it’s very difficult."]],[1770,["And you don’t know why you are feeling guilty."]],[1773,["All the time you’re feeling guilty"]],[1774,["but you don’t know why you’re feeling guilty,"]],[1776,["why these ideas of guilt are coming to you,"]],[1779,["that this feeling of guilt keeps you away from joy,"]],[1783,["from enjoying anything, from being spontaneous."]],[1788,["Why? And this explains why"]],[1793,["we sometimes are miserable for nothing at all."]],[1796,["Actually, God has not created us to be miserable."]],[1800,["He has made us so beautifully, so carefully."]],[1804,["He has created us with such love and compassion,"]],[1808,["not to make us feel miserable, not for anything."]],[1812,["He doesn’t give us any diseases, no problems."]],[1816,["But we have done these things to ourselves"]],[1818,["by going to extremes on the left or the right."]],[1822,["As I am today talking about only on the left,"]],[1824,["I would say that to feel miserable for nothing at all"]],[1828,["is also wrong, is being unjust to yourself."]],[1833,["The people who are left sided"]],[1835,["must know that they are the Spirit,"]],[1838,["that they are that beauty which has to come,"]],[1842,["which has to express itself."]],[1844,["That they are not the people who have to suffer"]],[1848,["all the time and to live like miserable people."]],[1852,["They are not."]],[1853,["But because they take so much upon themselves,"]],[1856,["bear so much upon themselves, they become like that."]],[1860,["And to avoid that bearing up"]],[1863,["they may take to some other habits, you see."]],[1865,["Many people take to alcohol"]],[1866,["also for reason because they can’t bear the pangs of life,"]],[1871,["they can’t bear it. That’s why they take to it."]],[1873,["But once the Spirit is awakened within you,"]],[1876,["you become so strong, you become so joyous,"]],[1881,["so spontaneous that all these things drop out,"]],[1884,["all those things, so-called diseases,"]],[1887,["so-called habits, just drop out"]],[1891,["and you become a new, blooming personality."]],[1895,["Now the basics of having this center within you –"]],[1902,["you can blame God for that, “Why did He give us"]],[1905,["these centers on the left hand side, what was the need?"]],[1908,["He should not have given these left sided ones,"]],[1910,["so we would have been just in the center to go.”"]],[1913,["But the trouble is, the human beings have to know"]],[1917,["in their own freedom, how to deal with themselves."]],[1921,["They have to learn little hard way the wisdom."]],[1925,["They have to know by going to extremes they have suffered."]],[1930,["They have to realize it"]],[1932,["because if they have to become truly, absolutely free"]],[1938,["they have to rise in their wisdom."]],[1943,["If they’re not wise people,"]],[1945,["then they cannot enter into the Kingdom of God"]],[1948,["because they’ll be abandoned people."]],[1949,["Say, people who are abandoned,"]],[1952,["who don’t understand any laws or regulations,"]],[1955,["if you get them in England, we’ll have to put them in jail."]],[1959,["In the same way, human beings who have not got"]],[1962,["that wisdom within themselves –"]],[1965,["through sufferings only one learns,"]],[1967,["but we should not ask for suffering."]],[1969,["When we ask for sufferings,"]],[1971,["we are asking actually for mistakes to begin with."]],[1974,["How will you suffer if you do not commit mistakes?"]],[1976,["So when we ask for sufferings we are committing mistakes."]],[1980,["So what we should ask for is nothing but our Spirit."]],[1984,["And if you ask for your Spirit,"]],[1986,["it is your own and you have to get it,"]],[1989,["it is in your own right that you’re going to get it."]],[1993,["Is no way that I’m obliging you or doing something special for you,"]],[1997,["it’s all there. You are like a light which is just to be enlightened"]],[2001,["because I’m an enlightened light"]],[2004,["and you become an enlightened light,"]],[2006,["you can enlighten other lights also."]],[2008,["It’s very simple."]],[2010,["If you become an enlightened light, you can enlighten others."]],[2013,["You don’t have to bother about anything else then."]],[2015,["You become an enlightened light yourself, that’s the point."]],[2020,["It is all there, it is all your own, you have to just have it."]],[2024,["It is as simple as that."]],[2027,["There is nothing very complicated as these people make it"]],[2032,["or anything that these philosophers have put before you."]],[2035,["Nothing of the kind."]],[2037,["It’s very simple, it is within you, it is spontaneous,"]],[2041,["it is a living process,"]],[2042,["as in living process you have become human beings,"]],[2045,["you are going to become super human beings."]],[2047,["It’s absolutely spontaneous, you can’t pay for it."]],[2051,["How can you pay? I mean, absurd it is!"]],[2054,["If it is a living process"]],[2058,["how can you pay?"]],[2059,["How much do you pay to the tree to grow up?"]],[2062,["I mean in anything living, do we pay anything?"]],[2064,["How much do we pay our nose to breathe?"]],[2067,["Can we pay for it? It’s absurd, it’s ridiculous."]],[2071,["Can we pay for it? We cannot, it’s a living process,"]],[2074,["we have to become, an egg has to become a chick."]],[2078,["Now how much do you pay an egg to become a chick?"]],[2081,["Or how much does the egg pay to the mother"]],[2085,["for becoming a chicken?"]],[2090,["It’s that ridiculous, but we never understand"]],[2094,["that living things are so spontaneous."]],[2096,["We never see living things, we live with matter,"]],[2099,["we live with the dead, not with the living things."]],[2102,["If you start watching a tree, you start watching a flower,"]],[2105,["how it becomes a fruit."]],[2109,["You can’t even watch because it does it so slowly,"]],[2112,["you can’t even watch a flower becoming a fruit."]],[2115,["Suddenly you find all coming up."]],[2117,["Like when I came to London from India"]],[2121,["I found all the trees were bare,"]],[2124,["absolutely like dry sticks, absolutely like dry sticks."]],[2128,["Within a week, what I find is the green coming up;"]],[2133,["and within second week it was all lush, you can’t believe it."]],[2138,["We never even notice, we take it for granted,"]],[2141,["it’s happening. How does it happen? It’s a miraculous thing."]],[2145,["If you see it, it’s miraculous!"]],[2146,["How these flowers,"]],[2148,["for example the particular flowers are only on a particular tree"]],[2151,["and others, another, are on another tree. How does it happen?"]],[2156,["Who chooses them? Who puts them in proper shape?"]],[2158,["Who organizes all that?"]],[2160,["And this is what one has to realize"]],[2163,["and that is the All Pervading Power of God"]],[2165,["that does all the living work."]],[2169,["And once you become that – the Spirit –"]],[2173,["then this power starts flowing through you."]],[2175,["You feel the power through you as Christ was touched"]],[2179,["and He said some power has gone to someone, like that."]],[2184,["You just become a medium of that power flowing."]],[2188,["But you are empowered to manoeuvre it,"]],[2192,["to manage it, to understand it."]],[2194,["You know completely about it,"]],[2196,["you know how to give it, you know to how to work it out,"]],[2198,["you know how to cure others, cure yourself."]],[2203,["You know the complete working of your machinery."]],[2207,["Apart from that, you get the powers"]],[2209,["to overcome all the problems of your own machinery also."]],[2215,["It’s so fantastic,"]],[2217,["whole thing sounds very fantastic"]],[2219,["because we have never seen this before."]],[2221,["But to us it doesn’t sound fantastic when we see"]],[2224,["all these flowers suddenly turning into fruits."]],[2228,["It doesn’t sound."]],[2230,["But we see human beings turning into fruits,"]],[2233,["then it sounds very fantastic, “How can that be?”"]],[2236,["It has never happened before."]],[2238,["Only one person would get realization"]],[2240,["and it was such a difficult thing and nobody got it."]],[2243,["How is it today?"]],[2246,["I say, it's the blossom time, which is been promised,"]],[2250,["which is been already prophesized."]],[2254,["Even a great poet in your country,"]],[2257,["William Blake, has prophesized it."]],[2259,["He said these times will come,"]],[2261,["when men of God will become prophets"]],[2266,["and these prophets"]],[2268,["will have power to make others prophets."]],[2270,["I mean nobody could be more precise than Blake, I tell you."]],[2273,["He was so great to say this will happen"]],[2277,["and this is what we have to expect."]],[2280,["when we go to anybody for seeking."]],[2282,["Have we become prophets? And what is a prophet?"]],[2285,["Prophet is a person who is a collective being"]],[2288,["and who knows all about it, who is the master."]],[2293,["We call prophet a master."]],[2296,["And that’s what you have to become: The master!"]],[2299,["And that mastery is very simple because it’s all built within you"]],[2304,["just it has to be connected."]],[2307,["Like anything like a television set is to be connected to the mains,"]],[2311,["it’s all built in, it’s there, it just starts working."]],[2313,["In the same way you are that, you are that."]],[2318,["Just it is to be connected."]],[2319,["Whatever may be your caste, community, race,"]],[2323,["nationality, shapes, heights –"]],[2327,["anything whatever you may be, makes no difference"]],[2330,["because all of you have got this great thing within you,"]],[2333,["this power of a rebirth"]],[2337,["and you are to be born again, and you will be born again."]],[2340,["Why not today?"]],[2343,["There’s nothing to get angry, because people get angry sometimes"]],[2347,["because they don’t like anybody telling them"]],[2352,["about something which - of which they themselves are feeling bad."]],[2357,["They don’t like it."]],[2358,["For example if there’s a drunkard and he drinks too much,"]],[2362,["he’s an alcoholic, he doesn’t like it"]],[2364,["and he feels bad, and if somebody tells him,"]],[2366,["even in the most gentlest way that “You’d better give up drinking\","]],[2370,["he doesn’t like it."]],[2373,["But what I am saying is not that you should not do it,"]],[2377,["I said it will happen that it just drops out."]],[2380,["I don’t say, “You don’t do this” or “Don’t do that”,"]],[2383,["but it just happens."]],[2384,["And you must first understand what is the problem"]],[2388,["and how the problem is overcome."]],[2391,["That’s why I have to talk,"]],[2393,["otherwise there’s no need to talk about it all, it just works out."]],[2397,["It just works out because you are just ready to have it"]],[2399,["and you just get it. I don’t do anything."]],[2402,["I’m just a catalyst, I should say that it works out."]],[2407,["I hope you’ll ask Me some questions about it first,"]],[2410,["before we go in for any realization."]],[2415,["If you have any questions, please ask. You must ask."]],[2427,["Yes?"]],[2428,["Man: Is there any difference to what You are saying and"]],[2432,["what guru Maharaji …"]],[2436,["Who?"]],[2437,["Man: Guru Maharaji"]],[2439,["Now, I’ll tell you one thing."]],[2441,["When you talk about any guru I don’t want to go into controversies."]],[2445,["All right? That’s first thing I’ll tell you."]],[2447,["But I will tell you to ask yourself or ask anyone,"]],[2450,["What has he done for anyone?"]],[2453,["Has he been able to give you any power,"]],[2456,["or anyone the power? All right?"]],[2459,["Now, I can tell you all these who are here"]],[2461,["who are realized souls who are here,"]],[2463,["they are just like you to look at."]],[2464,["Of course from face you can make out that they’re very relaxed"]],[2467,["and very happy people."]],[2469,["But they can cure people,"]],[2471,["they can give realization to people,"]],[2474,["they understand everything that is"]],[2476,["wrong with you and with themselves also."]],[2480,["So what has he done to your awareness?"]],[2483,["Nothing."]],[2487,["Now, his disciples, what have they achieved?"]],[2491,["You ask them, “Where is the Kundalini of this person?"]],[2494,["What is the problem of this lady or"]],[2496,["what is weighing upon her mind?” They won’t be able to say."]],[2499,["If you cannot even make out what’s wrong with another"]],[2502,["person or with yourself, how are you going to help?"]],[2506,["All such people, what do they do? Let us see."]],[2509,["Simple thing is that they can mesmerize you."]],[2514,["You may feel happy for a while,"]],[2516,["it’s just like drinking, you know, if you drink, you feel happy."]],[2520,["But, by drinking, what have you achieved?"]],[2523,["Have we become masters?"]],[2529,["All of them are like that."]],[2531,["You see, this gentleman, so obviously"]],[2534,["because he asked for Rolls Royce."]],[2536,["What is a Rolls Royce for a prophet?"]],[2538,["I mean what does it matter? You see My point?"]],[2542,["This is so obvious, I mean this is so logically obvious."]],[2545,["First of all, anybody who takes money from you is a parasite,"]],[2548,["simple as that."]],[2550,["And to ask for Rolls Royce of all the things, can you see?"]],[2553,["You have got Christ."]],[2555,["You can see from Christ’s life. Will He care for your Rolls Royces?"]],[2561,["To such a person - He’s a king, He doesn’t bother"]],[2564,["whether He has a Rolls Royce or not,"]],[2566,["whether He sleeps on the ground or not, makes no difference."]],[2568,["Such a person doesn’t care for anything,"]],[2570,["because He is in comfort, He’s got His own comfort."]],[2576,["He is a man of Self-respect."]],[2579,["Do you think will He ask for anything whatsoever?"]],[2582,["I mean it’s so obvious,"]],[2584,["for you people it is so obvious."]],[2586,["But when I talk to some people of this guru,"]],[2588,["the particular one you are telling Me,"]],[2591,["they said: “ Mother, we gave him the metal and he gives us the Spirit.”"]],[2594,["Can there be an exchange?"]],[2596,["Can you purchase your Spirit? Use your logic, all right?"]],[2601,["God has given us brains to understand, logically we can use that."]],[2604,["Can you, can you purchase, can you purchase the Spirit?"]],[2609,["Isn’t it so simple?"]],[2611,["We can't pay for it, My child, we cannot."]],[2617,["If you want to give Me a flower, all right."]],[2619,["It’s just an expression of your love, and that’s all."]],[2623,["But you can’t purchase Me. You can’t."]],[2628,["Your love can purchase Me, all right, that’s different."]],[2631,["But you can’t purchase Me with metal and money, can you?"]],[2634,["What is a Rolls Royce?"]],[2637,["I mean I don’t know what are all these crowns and things."]],[2640,["What are they good for? They don’t give you joy."]],[2643,["Go and ask the people who wear the crowns."]],[2647,["The other day I was with Mrs. Thatcher."]],[2648,["Poor thing, she was so miserable."]],[2652,["Yes, she was! You know I tried to sort of put her down,"]],[2657,["her vibrations. She was very miserable."]],[2659,["We were just across the table talking to each other."]],[2662,["And what I was doing was to balance her -"]],[2663,["poor thing, she was very, she’s very upset."]],[2669,["So, you must understand, you are too simple people,"]],[2672,["you are seekers of ancient times."]],[2675,["You are not seekers of today, you are seekers of ancient times."]],[2679,["And this time has been promised to you before, also."]],[2683,["And now you have to find it."]],[2686,["Now you must keep your logic straight forward."]],[2690,["I mean anybody who asks for Rolls Royce,"]],[2692,["I mean this is one of the stark examples I would say,"]],[2696,["cannot be any guru."]],[2700,["It’s the starkest one, absolutely one of the …"]],[2705,["But there are subtler ones."]],[2706,["He’s not so subtle."]],[2708,["You will get out of it in no time, I know, all of you."]],[2710,["But the subtler ones are even worse."]],[2714,["Some of them may not even ask for money, may not."]],[2718,["I don’t know of any, but there may be some"]],[2721,["because I heard about someone who doesn’t now take money,"]],[2726,["in India."]],[2727,["He has made money here and now he’s gone to India"]],[2731,["and he doesn’t take money from them."]],[2734,["But the one who has really not taken money,"]],[2739,["one person whom I know, has been using women."]],[2748,["He’s not interested in money part, he’s using your women."]],[2754,["You see so this is what it is, you must understand."]],[2758,["His interest is not in your Spirit,"]],[2760,["but in your purse or in your women. Imagine."]],[2764,["How can holiness be combined with these dirty habits of people?"]],[2770,["That means they themselves are under the control of their desires"]],[2775,["which are anti-God."]],[2782,["These are all anti-God activities."]],[2785,["And you people being so simple hearted, I tell you,"]],[2788,["you’re so simple hearted!"]],[2791,["If you tell an Indian that a guru takes a Rolls Royce, he says “Eh.”"]],[2795,["Immediately they’ll cancel. They know this guy, How can they?"]],[2800,["Nobody will give to any guru in India."]],[2802,["Gurus have to pay people sometimes first to entice them."]],[2808,["Westernized Indians, it’s different;"]],[2809,["but those who are real Indians, they, you see they are -"]],[2813,["people live with the mothers and they know what is what, you know."]],[2818,["Nobody can befool them, they’re very practical people."]],[2822,["Yes, My Child?"]],[2823,["Woman: Can you be healed through faith?"]],[2829,["O, the faith is two types,"]],[2832,["with what we call in Sanskrit is 'Shraddha',"]],[2835,["is different from what you call as faith."]],[2839,["In English they use it as “blind faith” and another as faith."]],[2843,["All right? We can make it like that."]],[2845,["Now, the blind faith is this, that “I have got faith in God"]],[2850,["and God will heal me.” This is one faith. All right?"]],[2853,["Another is a faith which is enlightened"]],[2857,["where I say you are the Spirit when you are connected."]],[2861,["Now, if you say that “I have faith in God”,"]],[2866,["you shouldn’t feel hurt when I tell you the truth, all right?"]],[2869,["Because if it is a blind faith means"]],[2872,["that you are not yet connected with the power. Not connected."]],[2877,["See, now supposing I start saying,"]],[2880,["“Christ, Christ, Christ, Christ!”"]],[2883,["Christ is not in my pocket."]],[2887,["I can’t even meet a prime minister or a queen"]],[2891,["without having a protocol or a connection or some sort of a,"]],[2896,["you see, position or, we can say, an authority. Isn’t it?"]],[2902,["Now when we talk of anyone like that,"]],[2904,["some people go on saying, “Rama, Rama, Rama, Krishna, Krishna\","]],[2907,["You see, these are all incarnations and Christ is the Son of God."]],[2913,["He is the Son of a King and you just can’t meet Him."]],[2918,["You can’t just call Him. He’s not at your beck and call,"]],[2925,["He’s not your servant. All right?"]],[2927,["Now, to having faith like that when you are not connected,"]],[2933,["if you are healed, you are healed by some other agencies,"]],[2936,["not by Christ."]],[2939,["But if you are a realized soul and then you are healed,"]],[2943,["then it is done by Christ."]],[2946,["I’ll tell you a difference, a very clear cut difference of healing."]],[2951,["We have in England – we had, I don’t know now if you have that one,"]],[2954,["it’s an organization called"]],[2956,["an 'International Curative Center of Late Dr. Lang'."]],[2962,["Now this Dr. Lang was dead, I mean he was late"]],[2968,["but he had a curative center."]],[2971,["You see, and this gentleman died"]],[2977,["and he possessed a man in Vietnam, a soldier,"]],[2984,["not his own son but a soldier."]],[2986,["Now this soldier was told by this fellow –"]],[2989,["I mean, they’re very honest people,"]],[2991,["being English, they are honest and they tell the truth, you see."]],[2993,["They don’t say that “we do it through God” or anything."]],[2996,["So he told that there are many doctors -"]],[3000,["I hope the doctors won’t mind - who have died"]],[3004,["and who were very ambitious are still wanting to cure people."]],[3009,["And \"He should  go back to my son and tell him all the story"]],[3012,["that I’ve come in you and my son will believe.”"]],[3016,["So he said, “How will he believe me?”"]],[3018,["He said, “No, no. I will tell you some secrets"]],[3020,["which only he and me, both of us share."]],[3023,["So he’ll definitely believe you.”"]],[3026,["So this fellow agreed. He was a very healthy fellow,"]],[3028,["actually this Spirit entered into him"]],[3031,["when he got into a certain shock,"]],[3034,["something he saw which shocked him in the war"]],[3036,["and this Spirit entered."]],[3038,["And he was carried by that Spirit somehow"]],[3042,["to England where he met his son and he told the whole story."]],[3047,["And the son had to believe because he knew so many secrets."]],[3050,["And they started this curative center."]],[3053,["Now how do I come to know of late Mr. Lang, is the thing."]],[3058,["They cured a lady who was in India -"]],[3064,["long time back- it was 1970 I’m telling you."]],[3067,["And she came to see Me,"]],[3068,["and she was all shaking, nervous, she’s like this."]],[3071,["I said, “What’s this?”"]],[3072,["She said, “I was sick with a certain disease"]],[3075,["and I was afraid of an operation"]],[3079,["and I came to know about this organization, I wrote to them"]],[3083,["and they wrote to me saying that 'at this time"]],[3086,["on this date we’ll enter into your body.\""]],[3089,["Openly, I mean they don’t say that “We are God” or anything."]],[3093,["“We’ll enter into your body"]],[3095,["and you’ll feel a little shaking, doesn’t matter,"]],[3097,["and you’ll sleep off and we’ll work it out.”"]],[3100,["And she said, “I got cured of that disease.”"]],[3104,["But after three years or so,"]],[3107,["the whole body started shaking"]],[3109,["and she couldn’t bear it anymore and she came to see Me."]],[3113,["That’s how I came to know about Dr. Lang, you see,"]],[3116,["that he had – this poor lady was tortured for three years,"]],[3122,["she suffered so much. And then she came to see Me."]],[3125,["So after Mr. Lang entered into her body – Dr. Lang –"]],[3129,["it was after six years that she came to see Me because"]],[3131,["three years she was all right,"]],[3133,["and after three years it started."]],[3135,["And that’s how I came to know all the Spirits"]],[3137,["that had entered into her, the doctors and all that."]],[3140,["It was a horrible case."]],[3142,["Of course she got cured later on, no doubt."]],[3145,["Because when you become the Spirit,"]],[3147,["you are in your fort, nobody can enter into your body."]],[3150,["You become something which doesn’t get contaminated,"]],[3155,["doesn’t get over powered, nobody can dominate."]],[3161,["And that’s how she got cured."]],[3162,["So with faith, if somebody says, “Oh, you will be healed” you see"]],[3168,["and they start shouting and screaming and this and that,"]],[3170,["and suddenly you might feel, maybe there’s a Spirit."]],[3174,["They replace also sometimes these Spirits, it’s very surprising."]],[3178,["They can replace a Spirit from one to another."]],[3180,["I’ve seen such cases also."]],[3182,["All kinds of things I have seen in Spirits."]],[3184,["The other day, only about eight days back, wasn’t that,"]],[3188,["Marie, when this charismatic fellow came in?"]],[3192,["Eight days back in France a gentleman came in."]],[3197,["Young fellow, must be about twenty-four or so."]],[3203,["He got into such a big agitation and started crying"]],[3208,["and a funny type of a thing that I’ve never seen,"]],[3212,["a Spirit, entered into him."]],[3214,["Whole body was shaking. And I mean he fell down,"]],[3217,["he started crying, weeping, all sorts of things happened."]],[3220,["And he said that “I went to charismatic movement where I got it,"]],[3223,["and many get it.\""]],[3225,["And they think Holy Ghost has entered into them."]],[3227,["Now just imagine. How can Holy Ghost make you miserable?"]],[3231,["I don’t know from where these ideas come in."]],[3235,["And poor child, you know, he suffered so much. Now he’s all right."]],[3239,["But he couldn’t believe it that you could be all right,"]],[3242,["because he thought …"]],[3243,["and then they say,"]],[3244,["“These are your sins and you have to get over your sins"]],[3247,["and this is why you are, what’s happening to you,"]],[3249,["you still have done bad karmas, and this and that."]],[3252,["But your bad karmas and all those things"]],[3254,["can be solved when the Kundalini rises."]],[3258,["There is a center for this specially"]],[3261,["which is really being adorned by Jesus Christ here."]],[3271,["Did you tell them, about this center?"]],[3274,["All right."]],[3275,["So this is the center, that when the Kundalini passes through that –"]],[3278,["that’s why they say that you have to pass through it -"]],[3282,["He gets awakened, and when He gets awakened all these"]],[3286,["two pouches you see, they are of ego and superego, your conditioning"]],[3290,["and all your left sided problems and right sided problems"]],[3292,["are sucked in."]],[3294,["That’s why they said that He died for our sins."]],[3297,["He is described in the ancient Indian scriptures"]],[3300,["as Mahavishnu but you see"]],[3302,["when the missionaries went to India"]],[3305,["they gave a very wrong picture of Christ, absolutely wrong picture,"]],[3309,["so they were still expecting Mahavishnu to come in."]],[3313,["And this is what it is."]],[3314,["He’s supposed to be, according to missionaries,"]],[3319,["somebody who sort of converts people and all that nonsense. See?"]],[3324,["It’s not the real thing, that He is to be awakened within us."]],[3327,["He said that. He said, “I have to be born within you.”"]],[3331,["And that is what it is."]],[3333,["When Kundalini rises, She awakens that center within us"]],[3337,["and all our conditionings and egos are sucked in,"]],[3341,["a space is created"]],[3343,["here in the fontanel bone area through which the Kundalini comes in"]],[3346,["and you can feel the cool breeze from your head coming out."]],[3350,["That’s what it is. And you feel it in your hands."]],[3353,["It’s not just that you’re mad after someone, you see?"]],[3356,["It isn’t like that."]],[3359,["It’s not that way, you see, nothing of that kind."]],[3363,["You become a Self-respecting, normal, dignified personality"]],[3369,["of great Spiritual value, which you are."]],[3374,["All right?"]],[3375,["So this is what faith is and what is blind faith is."]],[3382,["Yes, My child."]],[3384,["Man: It seems very difficult the concept that"]],[3387,["Self-realization doesn’t involve some personal effort."]],[3393,["Can it really come to anybody in effect of how"]],[3398,["materialistic they are? Am I understanding this?"]],[3404,["Yes, it appears on the face of it very difficult"]],[3409,["and how people are materialistic is also true no doubt,"]],[3413,["but Spirit is much stronger than the matter."]],[3417,["And when It has to express, it"]],[3421,["completely crushes all that and It comes."]],[3425,["Now, we have here, most of you are English people I should say,"]],[3429,["westernized, very materialistic people they were,"]],[3432,["I should say, I mean living in that world,"]],[3434,["they may not have been that materialistic"]],[3436,["because if they are not seekers, they would not come to Me."]],[3440,["But a new being has been born."]],[3443,["If you look at an egg you feel, “Oh, what a hard stuff is this!”"]],[3448,["But if it is broken at the right moment,"]],[3451,["with the right understanding, it becomes a bird."]],[3455,["Because a living process is all,"]],[3457,["only the last breakthrough has to take place."]],[3460,["Apparently it looks difficult, but to Me it is not."]],[3466,["Perhaps I know the job."]],[3469,["All right?"]],[3474,["Yes, it looks … many people have said all kinds of things"]],[3477,["about Kundalini, also."]],[3478,["I must say some books I have seen have horrified."]],[3480,["You see if you don’t know the job, everything –"]],[3482,["supposing if somebody else doesn’t know how to drive a car, you see,"]],[3486,["and he gets into the car"]],[3487,["the way he’d describe it would be horrifying."]],[3489,["You’d never get near a car, isn’t it? It’s like that."]],[3493,["The one who is not authorized and"]],[3495,["does not know the job should not do it."]],[3498,["But that’s what happens to you, that you become"]],[3502,["the Spirit, you become your own master"]],[3505,["and you become the master of this art – the master of this art!"]],[3509,["Yes, My child?"]],[3521,["I couldn't hear you?"]],[3527,["You mentioned hypnosis earlier and"]],[3529,["You also said that You regarded Yourself as a catalyst..."]],[3535,["Don’t You think that the hypnotist also regards himself as a catalyst?"]],[3539,["Yes, very true. Yes, yes, no doubt!"]],[3542,["Yes, yes that’s true, but the difference is this,"]],[3546,["that the hypnotist brings you under his power."]],[3550,["He doesn’t give you any power or no new dimension to your awareness,"]],[3555,["you see? There’s a tremendous difference between the two."]],[3558,["You see, you have got your own power within you."]],[3561,["Say, for example, all right, your Spirit there."]],[3564,["Now I’m a catalyst, you see, you can use a spoon"]],[3567,["for giving a poison or could use it for giving a nectar."]],[3572,["All right?"]],[3574,["So if you give the nectar, then it’s a great thing;"]],[3578,["and if you give the poison, it’s horrible. It’s like that."]],[3581,["Now the hypnotist uses hypnosis –"]],[3584,["how does he hypnotize is the point."]],[3587,["What he does is to push you into your subconscious,"]],[3590,["into your collective subconscious where he overpowers you."]],[3594,["You are under his power."]],[3596,["He says, “You become like a child”, you become like a child."]],[3599,["“You suck a little bottle”, you do it. What’s all this?"]],[3602,["But here you become"]],[3604,["the Spirit in the sense that you become collectively conscious."]],[3608,["It’s no hypnosis because you yourself can feel it."]],[3613,["Now, say example you take ten children who are realized souls."]],[3617,["There are some children who are realized souls,"]],[3619,["even little children."]],[3621,["And you take them near a person"]],[3623,["who is suffering from some trouble, all right?"]],[3626,["Now you tie up their eyes"]],[3628,["and ask them, “What’s the problem of this gentleman?”"]],[3631,["They will raise the same fingers,"]],[3633,["all of them will raise the same fingers, say \"This is burning.\""]],[3637,["You see, because the sensation you feel –"]],[3639,["of burning, of numbness or of cool breeze,"]],[3644,["a new awareness of a vibratory nature is born within you."]],[3649,["Not with hypnosis."]],[3650,["On the contrary, after hypnosis you feel so tired and finished"]],[3654,["as if somebody has been riding your horse."]],[3659,["It’s just the other way round."]],[3660,["And you start growing into you and understanding,"]],[3663,["you can cure people you understand what are the centers"]],[3667,["that are catching,"]],[3669,["you understand what are the centers of another person that are catching."]],[3672,["In the beginning sometimes people have confusion, I've seen,"]],[3675,["that they don’t know whether these are my centers or your centers."]],[3679,["But we have ways and methods by which you can discriminate."]],[3682,["You can see which are your centers catching"]],[3684,["and which are the centers the other person catching."]],[3686,["You also know how to get them all right,"]],[3690,["you also know how to give realization to others,"]],[3693,["and to empower them with their own powers."]],[3697,["It’s just the opposite."]],[3700,["But catalyst could be horrifying,"]],[3703,["and catalyst could be just heavenly."]],[3712,["Question: Can a person selfrealize themselves"]],[3717,["through their own effort (...)?"]],[3719,["With their own effort?"]],[3723,["O, that I don’t think is possible, you see, because"]],[3726,["like a light which is enlightened can only enlighten another light."]],[3731,["But what I’m saying, that even supposing like Buddha, you see,"]],[3737,["He got His realization when He was absolutely tired"]],[3740,["and He had to have it. Of course the Holy Ghost did that."]],[3743,["He could not have done it on Him,"]],[3745,["but He got the realization there"]],[3748,["because it was a different circumstance which He had to live,"]],[3752,["He didn’t have to talk about God,"]],[3754,["He didn’t have to talk about the whole thing."]],[3756,["Because people were so much engaged"]],[3760,["in talking of big things like God"]],[3763,["and about all kind of deities, this, that,"]],[3766,["there was a big confusion."]],[3768,["And somebody was to be realized at that time"]],[3770,["who would just localize it and say,"]],[3772,["“Only Self-realization! Don’t talk of God or anything, forget it.”"]],[3776,["That’s why He got realization like that."]],[3779,["But you cannot get realization just like that –"]],[3782,["only possession you can get. You cannot."]],[3786,["Somebody who is an enlightened soul,"]],[3789,["such an enlightened soul doesn’t take money from you."]],[3793,["Normally, you see, people don’t want to give you realization."]],[3796,["Ninety-nine percent of those who are really realized,"]],[3799,["they will throw stones at you, they won’t have anything to do with you"]],[3801,["because their experiences of human beings are horrifying."]],[3805,["If you go and talk to them, they’ll tell Me,"]],[3807,["they told Me that “Wait for twelve years."]],[3810,["See, Mother, they will all finish You off,"]],[3813,["they’ll kill You, they’ll do this.”"]],[3815,["It’s very venturesome to deal with human beings"]],[3817,["because they’ll be very egoistical and they will never accept you."]],[3821,["But if you take like this, like"]],[3827,["somebody who knows, is a help, isn’t it?"]],[3832,["And realization is not possible, is not possible"]],[3837,["to be done by yourself. It’s not possible."]],[3841,["Because if a, say, a candle which is not enlightened"]],[3845,["wants to get itself enlightened,"]],[3847,["the light has to be brought, isn’t it?"]],[3850,["It’s so simple as that."]],[3852,["But one should not feel bad about it, actually."]],[3855,["See, I don’t know how to drive, somebody drove Me down here."]],[3858,["I didn’t feel bad that he had to drive Me down, did I?"]],[3863,["And I only know one job. I don’t know many."]],[3865,["Many jobs I don’t know, I don’t know how to operate bank,"]],[3867,["I don’t know how to write a check, I’m hopeless in many things."]],[3872,["I don’t know how to open a can, maybe."]],[3874,["But I know how to open the Kundalini."]],[3877,["All right? So if I know one job, why should you mind?"]],[3880,["After all, we depend on each other for everything, isn't it?"]],[3885,["So why not, if I know the job, what’s the harm?"]],[3888,["And you will know, too."]],[3891,["You will know, too."]],[3893,["But it cannot be done by yourself."]],[3895,["But actually in this you’re not obliged for anything."]],[3903,["I just do it because I love it."]],[3906,["It’s just emits, I don’t do anyway, I’m just flowing,"]],[3908,["I don’t know how it happens, just it’s flowing."]],[3919,["I just love for love’s sake."]],[3921,["Just, you can’t believe such a person can exist,"]],[3924,["but I do really, I am like that."]],[3927,["Sometimes you might even,"]],[3928,["some of the Sahaja Yogis do feel that I’m too compassionate"]],[3932,["and that I should be rather strict with people and things like that,"]],[3935,["you see, they come and tell Me some wisdom about it."]],[3943,["You see they think I’m not so practical,"]],[3946,["but this is the most practical thing."]],[3950,["Yes, I know they make mistakes"]],[3953,["because they don't know they are walking in darkness."]],[3955,["If you are walking in darkness, you will bang at something."]],[3958,["Then only thing you can do is to have compassion for them"]],[3960,["because they can’t see, they are blind. Isn’t it?"]],[3965,["How can you have any anger or temper?"]],[3979,["And moreover, I would request you not to have any misidentification"]],[3983,["with anyone whatsoever."]],[3985,["You have to get to your Spirit, that’s the main thing."]],[3989,["If you still think of somebody, you see,"]],[3992,["like the lady – I don’t know, somebody might have sent her here,"]],[3994,["maybe. I don’t know why she got angry."]],[3996,["I didn’t say anything to hurt her."]],[3999,["Maybe she is possessed."]],[4001,["I don’t know why she has got angry with Me,"]],[4003,["and she just got up and just walked off saying that"]],[4005,["“You’re telling everything lies.”"]],[4010,["Why should I tell you lies?"]],[4012,["I don’t have to get anything out of you."]],[4017,["But why it happens? Because she’s not sensitive,"]],[4020,["she’s not sensitive to Divinity."]],[4025,["She doesn’t understand who’s Divine, who’s not. I don’t blame her."]],[4030,["She hasn’t got the sensitivity. It’s a calibre."]],[4032,["I have seen sahaja yogis now of different varieties have come to Me."]],[4036,["Some of them are of such a calibre you can’t even believe."]],[4039,["They get into realization, they know what it is,"]],[4041,["they have the pattern just like a diamond,"]],[4043,["they get it and they get into it."]],[4045,["They’re tremendous people."]],[4047,["There are some who slog behind."]],[4050,["Some of them who get realization but still"]],[4055,["they go on doubting, all kinds."]],[4059,["Doesn’t matter. I love all of them."]],[4065,["Yes, My child?"]],[4083,["He is a sahaja yogi?"]],[4089,["So what is he talking now?"]],[4097,["What did he say?"]],[4099,["He's saying Mother, if before realization"]],[4101,["we were such a horrible person that"]],[4103,["we gave cancer to everybody we met or something like this,"]],[4107,["after realization does the effects of that get taken away"]],[4112,["or what happens?"]],[4114,["Yah. I know it, so many things have happened."]],[4117,["We had somebody in Brighton, you remember –"]],[4121,["he’s here right now, I think –"]],[4124,["who was drunk when he came in."]],[4126,["He was very angry with Me, you see, to begin with."]],[4129,["He said, “How can I get rid of this trouble?"]],[4131,["I can’t believe You”, and all that."]],[4133,["And he’s all right, perfectly all right."]],[4135,["His change is so beautiful, you can’t… is he there?"]],[4138,["Yogi: Yes , I am."]],[4139,["May God bless you."]],[4145,["He’s so sweet now. The other day he came to see Me."]],[4149,["I said, “Look at that. He’s so sweet.”"]],[4153,["He was a very sweet man, wasn’t he?"]],[4156,["But something had put him up, made him upset, you see,"]],[4161,["that he became alcoholic, you see."]],[4164,["He’s all right."]],[4166,["And the compassion can only make you understand this"]],[4170,["that there’s a reason for this –"]],[4172,["He is a very sweet person, very sweet person no doubt."]],[4177,["But something had gone wrong with him."]],[4180,["It’s all right."]],[4184,["So this happens, it’s true."]],[4187,["Sahaja yogis realize this."]],[4190,["Some, of course, I must say, go little bit, doesn’t matter."]],[4195,["They’ll come up, all of them will come up,"]],[4197,["I’m sure of it."]],[4203,["Everyone is made for it."]],[4206,["Actually, the Divine is anxious to give you realization –"]],[4210,["much more, much more anxious than you are."]],[4214,["If there were thousand people today,"]],[4215,["I would have given them realization better."]],[4218,["But very few people take to reality, you see now."]],[4221,["That guru Maharaji, thousands are like mad after him, isn’t it?"]],[4227,["He’s given nothing to the poor people."]],[4232,["But for reality, there are very few."]],[4238,["Like the other day somebody asked Me a question,"]],[4240,["“Mother, why don’t You do it to everyone?”"]],[4243,["I said, “Where are they, everyone? They are missing."]],[4247,["Where are they? In this Brighton, how many there are?"]],[4252,["How many are here?"]],[4254,["All right? That’s the problem."]],[4257,["It takes time for people to love reality, time."]],[4263,["It’s such a beautiful thing."]],[4266,["And even they get realized, then they drop out, you see."]],[4270,["They say, “Oh, I’m all right now. I’m all right.”"]],[4272,["After one year they’ll appear."]],[4274,["That’s not the way."]],[4276,["You have to master this art, absolutely master it."]],[4279,["It is all free, absolutely free,"]],[4282,["now they are all sitting down here, they can say that."]],[4288,["Would You talk a bit more about Self-realization and"]],[4291,["and, You know, what’s necessary to enhance that?"]],[4295,["Yes, Yes, I will be in My next lecture, one by one."]],[4300,["Now I’m talking of the left side, the right side,"]],[4302,["and then the center, and then also, of course about the Spirit,"]],[4306,["definitely, hundred times, that’s what I have to do."]],[4309,["But gradually I have to build you up. All right?"]],[4312,["I will definitely. You won’t believe,"]],[4316,["I think I have given five hundred lectures already"]],[4319,["in London, at least."]],[4321,["And it doesn’t end. Every time they say,"]],[4323,["last time I spoke they said, \"Mother,"]],[4324,["it was absolutely a new dimension You talked about”, you see."]],[4328,["I don’t know."]],[4329,["Kerry told Me first time he touched his vibrations so much"]],[4332,["with My lecture, I don’t know what I touched him so much."]],[4336,["Yes, it’s surprising."]],[4338,["He’s from Australia."]],[4340,["Australians do well."]],[4344,["Very fast work."]],[4346,["So, all the questions are over now? Should we have it?"]],[4349,["What of Karma?"]],[4351,["Eh?"]],[4353,["Karma? Karmas are when you do any work"]],[4358,["or anything with your right side action"]],[4363,["then the effects of that accumulate within you as an ego"]],[4369,["because you think you are doing it."]],[4370,["Actually, we don’t do anything substantial."]],[4373,["What we do is a dead work."]],[4375,["Like as I said we make a chair out of a dead, a tree."]],[4378,["That’s all we do."]],[4380,["What work we do is an idea we have we are doing work."]],[4382,["What work are you doing?"]],[4384,["Can you convert this into a fruit?"]],[4386,["We can’t even put fragrance into it."]],[4390,["So this myth, you see, works as ego within us"]],[4393,["as shown here, which I will be speaking tomorrow about, all right?"]],[4396,["And this is what is that we think we are doing this work,"]],[4399,["that work, and this ego thinks that"]],[4403,["if you have done bad work or good work we have to suffer."]],[4408,["You see, a tiger doesn’t feel that way."]],[4410,["If tiger has to eat, it must kill."]],[4413,["It kills the animal, eats it, finished."]],[4416,["It doesn’t sit down and sulk, “Oh, God, I should not have done it."]],[4420,["I should become vegetarian.”"]],[4425,["It doesn’t accumulate any, any, any karmas in it, all right?"]],[4430,["But we human beings do. Why?"]],[4432,["Because we are closed."]],[4434,["We are closed. See here, we are closed."]],[4437,["They are open."]],[4439,["Whatever they do, they are not bothered."]],[4441,["But we are bothered about what we do because we think we do."]],[4447,["And when, as I said, this center is opened out, He sucks our karmas,"]],[4454,["and the so-called karmas are nothing but sins, you see."]],[4458,["In a biblical language we can call it as sin, you see."]],[4461,["And they’re all sucked in"]],[4465,["by this powerful Deity of Christ awakened within us."]],[4471,["And you get beyond it because it is the ego that does the karma."]],[4474,["When your ego is finished, where there are the karmas?"]],[4478,["They are finished, too."]],[4485,["Then you don’t say, “I did it.”"]],[4487,["What you will say,"]],[4489,["“Mother, it’s not working out, it’s not going up.”"]],[4492,["Now what is this 'it'? It becomes a third person."]],[4495,["“It’s flowing. The vibrations are not coming.”"]],[4498,["You see, you don’t say, “I - I am doing this realization."]],[4501,["I am raising the Kundalini”, they don’t say so."]],[4504,["They say, “It’s not rising.”"]],[4508,["You become a third person. That third person is the Spirit."]],[4512,["Where you do not say that “I should do it.”"]],[4516,["Even if it’s your son, you'll say,"]],[4517,["“Mother, it’s better he gets realization.”"]],[4520,["All right. You’ll see. Try. It doesn’t work out."]],[4524,["All right, then should I give a certificate?"]],[4526,["He said, “How can You give certificate, Mother, how? Kundalini,"]],[4529,["Kundalini has not risen.” Everyone knows, you see,"]],[4532,["whether it’s your father, mother, sister - anyone –"]],[4535,["if they’re not realized, they know they’re not realized, so what?"]],[4539,["They just know."]],[4542,["And this granddaughter of Mine, who was - she’s here now -"]],[4545,["she is a born realized,"]],[4547,["and she was hardly about five years of age, I think,"]],[4550,["when they went to Leach."]],[4552,["And there was one lama sitting"]],[4553,["with a shaved head and all that, wearing and all that."]],[4556,["Everybody was touching his feet."]],[4558,["And the parents also, not realized, My daughter is not realized,"]],[4561,["so she also touched his feet."]],[4562,["She couldn’t bear it anymore now, it was too much for her."]],[4565,["She was sitting in a higher block."]],[4568,["She went, put her hands back and looked at him, turning,"]],[4571,["She says, “What do you mean by asking everybody to touch your feet?"]],[4574,["You’re not even a realized soul!"]],[4578,["By wearing this dress of yours and shaving your head"]],[4581,["you think you can ask people to touch your feet?”"]],[4584,["Little child of five years, yet she understands."]],[4589,["We had once a program in India"]],[4591,["when they invited Me as a chief guest and"]],[4594,["for this Raman worship - was a realized soul-"]],[4597,["and one gentleman from Ramkrishna ashram, the head of that,"]],[4600,["was sitting with his big orange robe, you see, sitting there."]],[4606,["And My, another granddaughter, she was sitting in the front row."]],[4610,["She couldn’t bear him anymore so she shouted from there,"]],[4613,["“Mother, the one whose wearing a maxi dress,"]],[4617,["Grandmother, please ask him to get out,"]],[4618,["he’s giving heat to all of us.”"]],[4620,["So you see, there were many sahaja yogis"]],[4622,["who were feeling the heat from the fellow"]],[4623,["and he thinks he’s a very Spiritual man."]],[4625,["And she just stood up,"]],[4626,["she said, “Ask him to go, he is wearing a maxi.”"]],[4629,["She didn’t understand it was a robe or thing."]],[4631,["Even children know"]],[4634,["who are realized souls and who are not,"]],[4636,["if they are born realized."]],[4638,["There are many children who are born realized these days."]],[4640,["The time of judgment, this is the time of judgment."]],[4645,["Of course about this I’ll tell you later."]],[4652,["Do You mind if I ask You a few questions?"]],[4655,["It’s all right, I don’t mind."]],[4657,["But what happens, if you ask too many questions"]],[4659,["sometimes it becomes mental activity"]],[4661,["and may delay further realization sometimes."]],[4665,["So I would advice you, if it is not so important, better keep it out"]],[4669,["because, you see, answering the question is only on mental level."]],[4672,["I’m talking something much beyond, you see."]],[4675,["So, it is something logically if you have understood Me -"]],[4679,["all right, let’s have it."]],[4680,["If it will work out, work out."]],[4682,["If it will not work out, doesn’t matter."]],[4683,["I’m here for three-four days, and we are going to work it out."]],[4687,["All right? So it’s better to keep your mind at rest."]],[4690,["Tell the mind, “You have asked many questions before,"]],[4694,["you have thought of many things, now the time for you to receive"]],[4699,["the blessings of your own being.” All right?"]],[4704,["If you tell your mind, it will rest."]],[4705,["It’s a, it’s a wonderful thing, mind is."]],[4709,["If the mind knows what you want,"]],[4713,["and if it is the reality, it supports you and helps you very much."]],[4718,["The same mind which can go astray, you see,"]],[4721,["it’s like sometimes like a donkey."]],[4723,["Like Christ used donkey just to suggest the mind"]],[4729,["that if you allow it to go astray"]],[4734,["it will take you to all kinds of things,"]],[4736,["but if you control it, it takes you there where you have to go."]],[4742,["You just make him keep quiet."]],[4745,["It’s better to keep quiet at mind level."]],[4748,["And that’s why I answered your questions"]],[4750,["because later on when the Kundalini’s rising,"]],[4753,["at that time, the mind should not stand up, isn’t it,"]],[4756,["to say that “I haven’t asked this question.” That’s why."]],[4759,["Just to soothe it – there’s no need –"]],[4761,["but, just to soothe it down, I do it. All right?"]],[4764,["So best thing is to get your realization is the best thing,"]],[4767,["otherwise this mind is quite a disturbing stuff."]],[4770,["It can come at the right time,"]],[4771,["when you are going to achieve your last breakthrough, it may stop."]],[4776,["All right?"]],[4777,["So if you have any immediate question"]],[4779,["by which you are really oppressed  then you must ask Me."]],[4782,["But if it is not so important, just give up."]],[4785,["Is it very important?"]],[4786,["Then it’s all right. He has realized it."]],[4790,["Now, I have to just request you one thing, if you don't mind,"]],[4796,["we have to take out our shoes,"]],[4797,["because the mother earth has such a lot, you see,"]],[4800,["so we have to take her help in every way possible."]]]);
